+# MASTER SYNTHESIZER — COMPLETE METHOD, LAYER & DOCTRINE COVERAGE DIRECTIVE
+
+**Mandatory companion to** `docs/master-synthesizer-implementation-spec.md`. This directive must be implemented, not merely pasted into a prompt. Read all production calculators, method registries, Canon retrievers, evidence packet builders and UI reading endpoints before claiming coverage.
+
+## Fundamental instruction
+**READ EVERY ACTUAL CALCULATION AND EVERY AVAILABLE INTERPRETIVE RESULT FIRST.** Perform all applicable computations in the background via their actual engines. Do not begin composing the narrative until the complete structured evidence, technique-level execution ledger, and interpretations are available. Compare ALL relevant layers, resolve reinforcement and conflict, and produce a **deep, unified, richly synthesized conclusion** weaving the relevant doctrines together in coherent human-language paragraphs. The visible reading is organized by human meaning and consequence, not a parade of method headings. Do not omit material findings. The complete per-technique record remains available in the technical annex.
+
+**Important:** A file, Canon entry, research inventory or method name is NOT proof that its calculation executes. Classify every method as `computed-with-result`, `computed-no-applicable-result`, `not-applicable`, `not-implemented`, `failed`, or `reference-only`. Do not fabricate missing values or promote research-only doctrine into calculated evidence. Where variants conflict, preserve their school and coordinate frame.
+
+## A. Fundamental chart / astronomical / positional layers
+- User-selected frame; The Absolute Babylonian fixed-star anchor and zero-tilt/no-precession settings; alternate Western tropical/Vedic sidereal modes only if explicitly selected.
+- God View fixed celestial reference AND Agent View observer/Ascendant horizon, side-by-side as distinct streams; synthesize the relationship between the two.
+- Sun, Moon, Mercury, Venus, Mars, Jupiter, Saturn, Uranus, Neptune, Pluto, North/South Nodes and any actually supplied additional points; longitude, degree, sign, speed, retrograde status, angular position, dispositors and rulership.
+- Ascendant, Descendant, MC/IC where supplied; Equal Houses anchored to Ascendant degree; every one of twelve houses, occupants, lords, aspects and cross-house interactions.
+- Conjunction, opposition, square, trine, sextile with actual orb and applying/separating status if supplied; additional aspects only when implemented/selected. Honor the existing Energy Read 5° orb and conjunction-as-harmonious scoring contract; do not change formulas.
+- Planetary day/hour; lunar phase; sect; dignities/debilities; essential and accidental strength, retrogradation, combustion/cazimi/under beams where computed; reception, dispositorship chains and angularity.
+- Fixed stars: positions, named contacts, independent meanings, configured fixed-star anchors and territory; do not invent contacts.
+- All actual calculated timing, active windows, peaks, easing, transits and progressed/period indicators if implemented.
+
+## B. Western, Hellenistic, medieval, relational and timing doctrines
+- Signs/elements/modalities; house significations, house rulers, angular/succedent/cadent, benefic/malefic condition.
+- Sect, planetary joys/rejoicing, overcoming, bonification/maltreatment, besiegement, translation/collection of light, reception, prohibition and perfection where computed.
+- Essential dignities: domicile, detriment, exaltation, fall, triplicity, bounds/terms, faces/decans; planetary condition, mutual reception, dispositors and planetary war where supported.
+- Lots/Parts including Fortune, Spirit, Eros and any other actually computed Arabic/Hermetic Lots; never claim absent Lots.
+- Annual profections, zodiacal releasing, triplicity lords, primary directions, antiscia, dodecatemoria and planetary periods only where executable.
+- Natal/Transit/Synastry/Horary special rules: significators, turned houses, Moon's course, applying/separating perfection, translation/collection, timing, relationship cross-chart aspects and reception.
+- Distinguish the user's Elemental Family Decans from Chaldean faces, Egyptian historical decans and Vedic Drekkana; never silently substitute.
+
+## C. Vedic / Jyotish
+- Rashi D1; relevant divisional charts D2, D3, D4, D7, D9, D10, D12, D16, D20, D24, D27, D30, D60 **only where actually computed**, with D1/D9 synthesis and the correct selected coordinate convention.
+- Nakshatras 27, padas, lords and activation; Vimshottari Dasha / Bhukti and other executable timing; Moon's mansion basis.
+- Graha Drishti, Rashi/Jaimini Drishti; lordships, functional benefics/malefics, Kendra/Trikona/Dusthana/Upachaya, Dharma/Artha/Kama/Moksha, yogakarakas.
+- Shadbala, Bhava Bala, Avasthas, Ashtakavarga BAV/SAV, Vargottama, planetary war and strength/condition gates when available.
+- Raja/Dhana/Arishta/Pancha Mahapurusha/other actual Yogas, cancellation (bhanga), Neecha Bhanga, Sade Sati, Dhaiya, Jaimini karakas and Prashna/Muhurta only if implemented.
+- Do not treat a Vedic doctrine description or imported research-index entry as an executed method.
+
+## D. Arabic / Persian / Manazil
+- 28 lunar Manazil: position, occupied/activated mansions, actual mansion contacts and cross-mansion aspect rules when computed.
+- Lots/Siham, Firdaria, almuten, dignities, planetary condition/hayz, receptions, perfection/prohibition, translation/collection of light, interrogational and electional rules when supported.
+- Preserve provenance for Abu Ma'shar, Masha'allah, al-Kindi, Al-Qabisi and school-specific variants; philosophical rays theory is not automatically a quantitative calculation.
+
+## E. Chinese celestial methods
+- 28 Xiu lunar mansions; actual boundary/coordinate model, planetary occupancy, activated mansions, Four Symbols/quadrants, related stellar officials and asterisms when available.
+- Multiple occupants can reinforce a mansion's activated testimony; do not arbitrarily multiply strength without an approved rule.
+- Five Phases/Wuxing, calendrical/Jupiter cycles, Ziwei Doushu, Bazi, Qi Zheng Si Yu, Fenye only if actually executable and relevant. Research inventory alone is not an engine.
+
+## F. Babylonian, Egyptian, Hermetic and Kabbalistic knowledge
+- Babylonian fixed-star catalog and relevant stellar symbolism; MUL.APIN, Enuma Anu Enlil, Venus omens, first/last visibility and historical horoscopes only when matching calculated observational prerequisites and documented rules exist.
+- Egyptian star-clock decans and heliacal traditions are separate from 10-degree zodiac decans.
+- Hermetic seven spheres, soul/cosmic correspondences, and historically attested planetary symbolism as interpretive context; do not invent metaphysical measurement.
+- Sefer Yetzirah: 3 Mothers, 7 Doubles, 12 Simples, letter/planet/sign correspondences; Four Worlds where supported, clearly distinguish correspondence from calculated celestial position.
+
+## G. Genesis, human reality, patterns, timing and power model
+- Genesis Astro Engine, Genesis Pattern Engine, Yoga Detector, seven-channel Human Behavioral Intelligence, Life Event and Sequence Intelligence, Canon Dossier, method resolver and evidence packet.
+- Behavioral and human-reality interrogation: what/why/how/consequence/meaning; observable manifestation, repeated patterns, competing drives, constraints, timing, external vs internal dynamics.
+- POWER → SAFETY → COMFORT → AUTHENTICITY → TRUST → SELF-SOVEREIGNTY: identify source, position, channel and manifestation when supported; avoid making factual claims about personal experiences absent user evidence.
+- Active timing and Harmonic Flow Clock, energy harmony/friction totals, house manifestation, when influences ease and do/avoid guidance only where actual calculation supplies it.
+- The question determines **emphasis**, not whether a method gets evaluated. Consider all methods and retain low-signal results in evidence annex; include material results in synthesis.
+
+## H. Occupancy, activation, reinforcement and contradiction
+- Mansion symbolism is always available as reference, but **active mansion testimony requires an actual occupying planetary body or a separately defined calculated activation rule**.
+- Multiple planets in one mansion require each actual occupant's distinct evidence; reinforcement must not become an unsupported numerical multiplier.
+- All houses matter. Do not automatically discard houses 3, 6, 8, 12 or any other house.
+- Evaluate both harmonious and frictional testimony, including strong contradictory configurations, before drawing conclusions.
+- Avoid counting the same source fact multiple times because several doctrines interpret it; distinguish independent evidence from alternate descriptions.
+- God and Agent frame differences, historical tradition differences, natal vs transit, and different timing windows must be reconciled explicitly.
+
+## I. Synthesis output contract
+The final reader-facing text should:
+1. Open with the **dominant integrated conclusion** in plain language, specific to the chart and question.
+2. Explain WHY by weaving together multiple relevant calculated layers in the same paragraph or connected narrative; not a Western paragraph followed by a Vedic paragraph and so on.
+3. Explain HOW it operates and WHAT IT LOOKS LIKE IN LIFE: concrete domains, behaviors, relationships, opportunities, obligations, obstacles and patterns grounded in actual evidence.
+4. Explain CONSEQUENCES, counterweights and meaningful contradictions without generic filler.
+5. Explain WHEN using actual available timing, not invented dates.
+6. Explain MEANING and end with a powerful, concise synthesis of the core pattern.
+7. Use substantive depth and detail proportionate to the question. Do not sacrifice meaningful findings for brevity; use a readable hierarchy and expandable details rather than repetitive lists.
+8. Retain an exhaustive **How was this calculated?** annex: every applicable method status, evidence ID, body, house, orb, degree, activation, provenance, strength and conflict; note missing methods.
+9. No generic interchangeable paragraphs, invented evidence, fabricated scores or unjustified claims of certainty. Keep symbolic interpretation distinct from empirical fact.
+10. Horary verdicts come from horary logic, Energy scores from Energy engine, synastry from both charts; synthesizer explains and unifies, never overrides authoritative results.
+
+## J. Concrete engineering acceptance tests
+- Inspect and enumerate the entire current source inventory before writing code: search all calculator implementations, exports, registry entries, method coverage, test fixtures, frontend mode routing and actual endpoint call sites. Produce a **machine-readable per-technique execution matrix** with `id, tradition, source file, function, prerequisite, reading modes, status, evidence fields, trace IDs`.
+- Test one chart where several traditions converge on a theme and ensure one synthesized paragraph integrates at least 3 **independent computed** layers with correct provenance.
+- Test conflicting doctrine/frame testimony and preserve differences without arbitrary suppression.
+- Test one inactive and one occupied lunar mansion; verify only occupied/explicitly activated testimony is labeled active.
+- Test incomplete/research-only techniques; ensure they appear as unavailable/reference-only, never as computed.
+- Test two different natal charts, transit timing, horary, synastry and Energy totals; confirm no hallucinated facts or cross-profile leakage.
+- Verify every material claim has source IDs and every method is accounted for in visible synthesis or technical annex.
+- Keep chart engines and formulas untouched. Run existing typecheck, test and build; provide before/after actual reading outputs and PR for review.
+
+## Source inventory pointers (not proof of execution)
+`server/astrologyKnowledge/methodCoverage.ts`; `server/astrologyKnowledge/evidencePacket.ts`; `server/astrologyKnowledge/canon/civilizationDoctrineInventory.ts`; `server/astrologyKnowledge/canon/importedCelestialDoctrineIndex.ts`; `server/astrologyKnowledge/canon/vedicJyotishCanon.ts`; `server/astrologyKnowledge/canon/chineseMansions28.ts`; `server/astrologyKnowledge/canon/manazil28.ts`; `server/astrologyKnowledge/canon/nakshatras27.ts`; `server/astrologyKnowledge/canon/decans36.ts`; `server/astrologyKnowledge/canon/seferYetzirah.ts`; `server/master-interpreter.ts`.
+
+**Definition of done:** Every implemented, applicable method is executed or retrieved and its results read; every method has a truthful status; all material findings are woven into one deep, integrated, coherent, evidence-backed conclusion, with complete technical evidence one tap away.
